{"product_id":"vcserum-and-lotion-set","title":"VC Spot-Removing Serum ✚ VC Whitening Freckles Face Cream (Set)","description":"\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"RBzad6Q18oXxRox512icdjO7nlh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gt8wdA49bojmFaxaxsRc8JKXnUg\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrighten, correct, and glow\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e— the VC Spot-Removing Serum\u0026amp; Face Cream (Set)\u003c\/strong\u003e targets dark spots and uneven tone for visibly clearer, radiant skin.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gt8wdA49bojmFaxaxsRc8JKXnUg\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0670\/0322\/0140\/files\/AAD2_9f93e0b8-93f6-4d5a-a67b-4aef49a584b9.webp?v=1746643440\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gt8wdA49bojmFaxaxsRc8JKXnUg\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LAIidQNRqowR8ax6BGpc3Iy8nDh\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThe \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e VC Spot-Removing Serum\u0026amp; Face Cream (Set) \u003c\/strong\u003eis formulated with high-potency Vitamin C to visibly reduce dark spots, freckles, and uneven pigmentation. Supported by dermatological insights and aligned with guidelines from leading skincare authorities, this dual-action regimen promotes brighter, clearer skin by targeting melanin at the source. Dermatologist-recommended and safe for daily use, it offers a gentle, non-invasive solution for restoring a radiant, even-toned complexion.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"The VC Spot-Removing Serum ✚ VC Whitening Freckles Face Cream Set is formulated with high-potency Vitamin C to visibly reduce dark spots, freckles, and uneven pigmentation. Supported by dermatological insights and aligned with guidelines from leading skincare authorities, this dual-action regimen promotes brighter, clearer skin by targeting melanin at the source. Dermatologist-recommended and safe for daily use, it offers a gentle, non-invasive solution for restoring a radiant, even-toned complexion.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+e1\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"7c966a16-583a-4550-89ad-e8b81cb3bb8f\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":56,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":505},\"recordId\":\"LAIidQNRqowR8ax6BGpc3Iy8nDh\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx\/text\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gt8wdA49bojmFaxaxsRc8JKXnUg\"\u003e\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"The VC Spot-Removing Serum ✚ VC Whitening Freckles Face Cream Set is formulated with high-potency Vitamin C to visibly reduce dark spots, freckles, and uneven pigmentation. Supported by dermatological insights and aligned with guidelines from leading skincare authorities, this dual-action regimen promotes brighter, clearer skin by targeting melanin at the source. Dermatologist-recommended and safe for daily use, it offers a gentle, non-invasive solution for restoring a radiant, even-toned complexion.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+e1\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"7c966a16-583a-4550-89ad-e8b81cb3bb8f\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":56,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":505},\"recordId\":\"LAIidQNRqowR8ax6BGpc3Iy8nDh\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx\/text\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0670\/0322\/0140\/files\/4_23d1e77f-4e85-4251-b908-5bf4421bc89b.webp?v=1746643491\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gt8wdA49bojmFaxaxsRc8JKXnUg\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WDCYdkYpHoW0ByxfK4qc8XqenCM\"\u003eBefore introducing our product, let’s see what our satisfied customers are saying about VC Spot-Removing Serum.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"The VC Spot-Removing Serum ✚ VC Whitening Freckles Face Cream Set is formulated with high-potency Vitamin C to visibly reduce dark spots, freckles, and uneven pigmentation. Supported by dermatological insights and aligned with guidelines from leading skincare authorities, this dual-action regimen promotes brighter, clearer skin by targeting melanin at the source. Dermatologist-recommended and safe for daily use, it offers a gentle, non-invasive solution for restoring a radiant, even-toned complexion.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+e1\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"75017002032