2aEAchUxtnzh\",\"LKqUdHg5so6CRbxHqjNcqC4Znif\",\"Ah9Ydjs7xoFDnixVuOScbFlPnph\",\"RGwHdDgOKoFWqBx0Uo4cpOHFn6e\",\"SYlEdsl41ot5JYxmLCFcmz7QnZe\",\"PYXMd5HbBowtnYx0kZrcg4nwnCb\",\"UTFrd2RIyooSg6xR5VAcd57nnve\",\"K6lzdIjL3oJR3ixl5ePccxMznoe\",\"FzMRdGRnkoaIdNxSfFzcMjzfn5c\",\"I8Bod7vVFok9Clx8H1HciPo7nCd\",\"X1fHd531DogM5RxdUWhcxqfmngQ\",\"V02wd5batogvWbx9CgVcOLfLnrh\",\"D1G2dQ0L9oUcWxxWUeScmSMLnFg\",\"XotVdwLhWolyIZxIZNNcK35rnIe\",\"GMNRdIh0oolIbqxjChmcPv0gnTh\",\"UARtd4nQGosCRlxo0vLchO1Tnxf\",\"FxhGdzEUHoJ7ZpxyiTic1Cf8nTd\",\"HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\",\"BR0Cdx7lBomIcaxVZvrctHfTnLg\",\"PWjFdSap9obByNxkYPGcqnLgn4e\",\"Llc0dk1oWodduyxhBPYcgy0Nn1b\",\"ODZfd409sose48xUTxrcp2bxnje\",\"KQsHdXbGIoi9rhxv1WNc4Newnbf\",\"I0lGddjNwooQwBxiCMQcnj0FnCb\",\"CsBvd3YQPoMzXMxIGKech7kznJb\",\"YoMvdqb5SoUlLyxD6RFcroa1nPd\",\"TQsXdMlK3oNY22xFmBVcxom8nxb\"],\"text\":{\"apool\":{\"nextNum\":1,\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]}},\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+2\"},\"text\":{\"0\":\"祛斑\"}}},\"align\":\"\",\"doc_info\":{\"editors\":[\"7501700203293016066\"],\"options\":[\"editors\",\"edit_time\"],\"deleted_editors\":null,\"option_modified\":null}}}},\"payloadMap\":{\"X1fHd531DogM5RxdUWhcxqfmngQ\":{\"level\":1},\"V02wd5batogvWbx9CgVcOLfLnrh\":{\"level\":1},\"D1G2dQ0L9oUcWxxWUeScmSMLnFg\":{\"level\":1}},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"pasteRandomId\":\"4e21d891-483c-4cc8-afcc-aa78e13f3cfb\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{},\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":108,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":267},\"recordId\":\"X1fHd531DogM5RxdUWhcxqfmngQ\"},{\"id\":113,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":34},\"recordId\":\"V02wd5batogvWbx9CgVcOLfLnrh\"},{\"id\":111,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":27},\"recordId\":\"D1G2dQ0L9oUcWxxWUeScmSMLnFg\"}],\"pasteFlag\":\"4ad43e54-9df5-4c8b-b560-0f8ca743f55b\"}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx\/record\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UARtd4nQGosCRlxo0vLchO1Tnxf\"\u003eI've been highly skeptical of dark spot remover claims after not finding any to work in the past. However, after a few more years of aging and many more brown spots on my face, I decided to finally give this one a try and I'm so glad I did. Although the serum hasn't completely removed most spots, it has lightened most of them remarkably. One large spot in particular right underneath one eye is almost completely unnoticeable now. I've been using it approx. six months and plan to continue doing so. Will try it out on my arms also to see if it works there too. It's inexpensive, easy to use, and has no discernible odor. The only slight downside for some might be that it's a bit drying on the skin. Overall, though, definitely recommend giving it a try.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxhGdzEUHoJ7ZpxyiTic1Cf8nTd\"\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e— Emma Johnson, 32, Denver, Colorado\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eItem type: VC Spot-Removing\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0670\/0322\/0140\/files\/500171732898195_pic-611.png?v=1746643853\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PWjFdSap9obByNxkYPGcqnLgn4e\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eClinically backed, this multi-ingredient VC Spot-Removing Serum\u0026amp; Face Cream (Set)\u003c\/strong\u003e stabilized Vitamin C, niacinamide, and soothing botanicals to fade spots, brighten skin, and reduce inflammation. Dermatologist-formulated and pharmacy-compounded for maximum efficacy, it promotes smoother, healthier skin with every use.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Clinically backed, this multi-ingredient VC duo combines stabilized Vitamin C, niacinamide, and soothing botanicals to fade spots, brighten skin, and reduce inflammation. Dermatologist-formulated and pharmacy-compounded for maximum efficacy, it promotes smoother, healthier skin with every use.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+86\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"f60737e7-23f4-4af7-b089-7ba49bb1cda5\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":54,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":294},\"recordId\":\"PWjFdSap9obByNxkYPGcqnLgn4e\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx\/text\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\"\u003e\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Clinically backed, this multi-ingredient VC duo combines stabilized Vitamin C, niacinamide, and soothing botanicals to fade spots, brighten skin, and reduce inflammation. Dermatologist-formulated and pharmacy-compounded for maximum efficacy, it promotes smoother, healthier skin with every use.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+86\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"f60737e7-23f4-4af7-b089-7ba49bb1cda5\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":54,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":294},\"recordId\":\"PWjFdSap9obByNxkYPGcqnLgn4e\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx\/text\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0670\/0322\/0140\/files\/ATTDX_GoldenBeeTag_BlemishRepairPeelGelMask-03.webp?v=1746643890\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-page-id=\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ODZfd409sose48xUTxrcp2bxnje\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cspan data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Clinically backed, this multi-ingredient VC duo combines stabilized Vitamin C, niacinamide, and soothing botanicals to fade spots, brighten skin, and reduce inflammation. Dermatologist-formulated and pharmacy-compounded for maximum efficacy, it promotes smoother, healthier skin with every use.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+86\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7501700203293016066\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"typ