e\u0026quot;],\u0026quot;recordMap\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;UARtd4nQGosCRlxo0vLchO1Tnxf\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;UARtd4nQGosCRlxo0vLchO1Tnxf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;snapshot\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;parent_id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;I0EYdj1eAozkSPxec5ccEcEjnUe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;children\u0026quot;:[],\u0026quot;comments\u0026quot;:[],\u0026quot;revisions\u0026quot;:[],\u0026quot;author\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;7501700203293016066\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;initialAttributedTexts\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;0\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;I've been highly skeptical of dark spot remover claims after not finding any to work in the past. However, after a few more years of aging and many more brown spots on my face, I decided to finally give this one a try and I'm so glad I did. Although the serum hasn't completely removed most spots, it has lightened most of them remarkably. One large spot in particular right underneath one eye is almost completely unnoticeable now. I've been using it approx. six months and plan to continue doing so. Will try it out on my arms also to see if it works there too. It's inexpensive, easy to use, and has no discernible odor. The only slight downside for some might be that it's a bit drying on the skin. Overall, though, definitely recommend giving it a try.\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;attribs\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;0\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;*0+l1\u0026quot;}},\u0026quot;apool\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;numToAttrib\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;0\u0026quot;:[\u0026quot;author\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;7501700203293016066\u0026quot;]},\u0026quot;nextNum\u0026quot;:1}},\u0026quot;folded\u0026quot;:false}},\u0026quot;HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;HEQEdFJ4so7TyjxMLPycXr92nCe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;snapshot\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;children\u0026quot;:[],\u0026quot;com